      <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
        <name>DecorationInformationCheckingItemTypes</name>
        <id>356</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>The pricing settings for each item kind have already been transferred, but they can be changed. You can include and exclude the following sections:</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>تنظیمات قیمت‌گذاری هر نوع قلم قبلاً منتقل شده است، اما قابل تغییر است. می‌توانید بخش‌های زیر را اضافه یا حذف کنید:</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Настройки ценообразования для каждого вида номенклатуры уже перенесены, но их можно изменить. Можно включить и исключить следующие разрезы:</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Her bir adlandırma türü için fiyatlandırma ayarları zaten taşınmış, lakin bunlar değiştirilebilirler. Şu kesintileri dahil edebilir ve hariç tutabilirsiniz:</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>Đã chuyển tùy chỉnh thiết lập giá cho từng dạng mặt hàng. Nhưng chúng có thể thay đổi. Có thể bật, tắt sử dụng các mặt cắt sau:</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>The pricing settings for each item kind have already been transferred, but they can be changed. You can include and exclude the following sections:</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>The pricing settings for each item kind have already been transferred, but they can be changed. You can include and exclude the following sections:</value>
        </title>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
        <userVisible>
          <common>true</common>
        </userVisible>
        <extendedTooltip>
          <name>DecorationInformationCheckingItemTypesExtendedTooltip</name>
          <id>358</id>
          <type>Label</type>
          <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
          <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
